1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,450
Is Research Center 2 worth about twenty dollars,
or will you pay to

2
00:00:08,450 --> 00:00:12,800
unlock upgrades you can't afford to finish?

3
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:17,600
Hey guys, Alexandre here from Alexandre Games.

4
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:24,000
I took a while to buy this myself.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:29,660
I wanted to know what it unlocked,
how it worked, and

6
00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:34,400
whether I would get enough value from it.

7
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:40,530
So today, I'll show you what you're paying for,
what

8
00:00:40,530 --> 00:00:43,760
still needs work after the purchase,

9
00:00:43,760 --> 00:00:47,440
and why I finally decided to buy it.

10
00:00:47,440 --> 00:00:51,760
Twenty dollars means different things
to different people.

11
00:00:51,760 --> 00:00:58,490
If you spend a little now and then,
this is a decision

12
00:00:58,490 --> 00:01:00,960
worth thinking about.

13
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:06,880
The first Research Center opens
through normal progress.

14
00:01:06,880 --> 00:01:12,080
The second requires a purchase.

15
00:01:12,080 --> 00:01:17,920
Buying it gives you a second research queue
and access to

16
00:01:17,920 --> 00:01:20,560
extra research branches.

17
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:26,400
But it doesn't give you all their bonuses
right away.

18
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:30,560
You still need to develop those technologies.

19
00:01:30,560 --> 00:01:37,340
That means spending resources,
waiting for research, and

20
00:01:37,340 --> 00:01:39,920
collecting Honor Marks.

21
00:01:39,920 --> 00:01:45,040
So before looking at the bonuses,
understand this:

22
00:01:45,040 --> 00:01:52,710
The purchase opens the door.
You still have to build what's

23
00:01:52,710 --> 00:01:53,520
behind it.

24
00:01:53,520 --> 00:01:59,100
This branch improves heroes from the tank,
support, healer,

25
00:01:59,100 --> 00:02:00,720
and control classes.

26
00:02:00,720 --> 00:02:04,630
Different technologies improve different stats,
including

27
00:02:04,630 --> 00:02:07,200
armor, magic defense, and attack.

28
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:12,150
For example, a technology that gives
support heroes more

29
00:02:12,150 --> 00:02:12,480
armor

30
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:15,920
benefits heroes in that class.

31
00:02:15,920 --> 00:02:22,640
It doesn't give that armor bonus
to every hero.

32
00:02:22,640 --> 00:02:26,160
That matters when choosing your research.

33
00:02:26,160 --> 00:02:31,840
Look at the classes in the teams
you actually use.

34
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:38,600
A bonus for several heroes you play every day
may help

35
00:02:38,600 --> 00:02:42,480
your account more than a bonus for heroes

36
00:02:43,040 --> 00:02:44,400
you rarely use.

37
00:02:44,400 --> 00:02:51,570
One early upgrade gives support heroes
half a percent

38
00:02:51,570 --> 00:02:53,200
more armor.

39
00:02:53,200 --> 00:02:59,760
That sounds small. But a percentage bonus
can give a larger

40
00:02:59,760 --> 00:03:00,160
number

41
00:03:00,160 --> 00:03:05,680
of extra armor points to a hero
who already has more armor.

42
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:09,040
It's still half a percent.

43
00:03:09,760 --> 00:03:13,760
It doesn't suddenly become a huge bonus.

44
00:03:13,760 --> 00:03:20,160
The value comes from building
several useful upgrades over

45
00:03:20,160 --> 00:03:20,560
time.

46
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:27,040
And each upgrade benefits all your heroes
in that class.

47
00:03:27,040 --> 00:03:29,920
More armor can help against physical damage.

48
00:03:29,920 --> 00:03:33,920
More magic defense helps against magic damage.

49
00:03:33,920 --> 00:03:37,200
Neither makes your team unbeatable.

50
00:03:37,200 --> 00:03:43,200
And these hero stat bonuses work
across game modes, so

51
00:03:43,200 --> 00:03:46,960
their value goes beyond the Realm.

52
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:52,080
If simple, honest guides like this
help you understand

53
00:03:52,080 --> 00:03:55,280
the game, consider subscribing.

54
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:59,520
Now, let's look at the troop upgrades.

55
00:03:59,520 --> 00:04:04,840
Troops PRO improves infantry,
spearmen, and archers

56
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:06,080
together.

57
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:11,760
You can develop stats such as attack,
defense, health, and

58
00:04:11,760 --> 00:04:17,440
lethality, along with troop capacity.

59
00:04:17,440 --> 00:04:22,400
For me, this is an important part
of the purchase.

60
00:04:22,400 --> 00:04:27,240
I'm thinking about my troops
and the Realm battles being

61
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:28,880
added to the game.

62
00:04:28,880 --> 00:04:33,840
And the Realm battles being added to the game,
as well as

63
00:04:33,840 --> 00:04:35,600
my heroes.

64
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:40,710
But I wouldn't buy something only because
a future battle

65
00:04:40,710 --> 00:04:42,800
might be difficult.

66
00:04:42,800 --> 00:04:49,200
Look at what the purchase offers
your account today.

67
00:04:49,200 --> 00:04:53,680
Combat Classes is another branch.

68
00:04:53,680 --> 00:05:00,960
It focuses on warriors, marksmen, and mages.

69
00:05:00,960 --> 00:05:07,540
In the requirements I'm showing here,
this branch needs twenty percent

70
00:05:07,540 --> 00:05:11,120
progress in Troops PRO before it opens.

71
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:17,360
So you can't jump straight to every hero
upgrade you want.

72
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:20,710
Depending on the class,
you'll find physical attack,

73
00:05:20,710 --> 00:05:24,900
magic penetration, health,
critical hit chance, and

74
00:05:24,900 --> 00:05:26,560
other bonuses.

75
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:34,630
There's even magic critical hit chance,
starting at one percent on the

76
00:05:34,630 --> 00:05:38,800
first level of that technology.

77
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:42,480
That adds a chance for a magic critical hit.

78
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:47,280
It doesn't mean every spell becomes stronger
every time.

79
00:05:47,280 --> 00:05:50,240
Now comes the part I

80
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:54,320
would check before spending money:
Honor Marks.

81
00:05:54,320 --> 00:06:00,940
Advanced research needs them,
along with regular

82
00:06:00,940 --> 00:06:05,600
resources like wood, iron, food, and stone.

83
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:09,770
You earn Honor Marks through
Guild Versus rewards,

84
00:06:09,770 --> 00:06:12,480
including progress

85
00:06:12,480 --> 00:06:15,920
chests and weekly or seasonal rewards.

86
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:20,100
If you rarely participate,
that can slow your progress

87
00:06:20,100 --> 00:06:21,280
after buying the center.

88
00:06:21,280 --> 00:06:26,930
Two research queues are useful
when you have enough

89
00:06:26,930 --> 00:06:30,880
resources to keep them working.

90
00:06:30,880 --> 00:06:34,560
They can't solve a shortage of Honor Marks.

91
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:38,880
Some events also reward you
for spending Honor Marks.

92
00:06:38,880 --> 00:06:42,800
I understand why that makes
buying the center tempting.

93
00:06:43,520 --> 00:06:47,280
But I wouldn't buy it just to finish
one mission.

94
00:06:47,280 --> 00:06:51,860
If you already planned an upgrade,
doing it during a

95
00:06:51,860 --> 00:06:55,040
matching event can give you extra rewards.

96
00:06:55,040 --> 00:07:00,270
Also, space for more research
doesn't confirm when

97
00:07:00,270 --> 00:07:02,720
new technologies will arrive.

98
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:08,960
I would judge the purchase
by what's available now.

99
00:07:08,960 --> 00:07:11,120
So, was it worth it for me?

100
00:07:11,840 --> 00:07:15,520
Yes. I bought it because I want to develop

101
00:07:15,520 --> 00:07:17,440
both my heroes and my troops.

102
00:07:17,440 --> 00:07:24,130
For a low spender who plays regularly
and plans to keep

103
00:07:24,130 --> 00:07:25,680
developing the Realm,

104
00:07:25,680 --> 00:07:29,600
I consider this one of the more useful
purchases.

105
00:07:29,600 --> 00:07:34,870
But if money is tight,
or resources already stop

106
00:07:34,870 --> 00:07:36,080
your research,

107
00:07:36,720 --> 00:07:41,110
I wouldn't rush. You still have progress
to make through

108
00:07:41,110 --> 00:07:42,560
your first center.

109
00:07:42,560 --> 00:07:49,940
If you decide this purchase is right for you,
you can

110
00:07:49,940 --> 00:07:53,840
support my work by using Creator Code

111
00:07:53,840 --> 00:07:58,800
ALEXANDREGAMES in the Hero Wars Alliance
Web Shop.

112
00:07:58,800 --> 00:08:01,520
It costs you nothing extra.

113
00:08:01,520 --> 00:08:06,960
Would you buy the second Research Center,
or would you

114
00:08:06,960 --> 00:08:09,760
rather keep playing without it?

115
00:08:09,760 --> 00:08:12,800
Tell me why in the comments.

116
00:08:12,800 --> 00:08:17,200
Leave a like, subscribe,
and I'll see you in the next guide.

